<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harwill rights offer 97.7 pct subscribed.</title>
<headline>Harwill rights offer 97.7 pct subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harwill Investments Ltd announced on Friday that 2.1 million shares or 97.7 percent of its rights offer had been subscribed for by its shareholders.</p>
<p>It said the balance of the offer had been take up by stockbroking firm Huysamer Stals Ltd in its capacity as underwriter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
